 Also called: BroadcastConcat, Concat Broadcast
 ## Overview
-MinkowskiBroadcastConcatenation broadcasts reduced global features to all input coordinates and concatenates them to the input features along the feature dimension [S1, S2, unofficial]. It aligns a single global feature vector with every active coordinate in the input tensor [S1, S2, unofficial]. Unlike sibling methods that perform element-wise arithmetic operations between local and global features, this method preserves both information types as separate channels [S1, S2, unofficial]. It builds on [MinkowskiBroadcast](8927-minkowskibroadcast.md) [G].
