 ## How it works
 **Inputs and Outputs:**
-- Input: `input`, a `SparseTensor` defining the output coordinates and containing local features [S1, S2, unofficial].
-- Input: `input_glob`, a `SparseTensor` containing features reduced to the origin (e.g., via global pooling) [S1, S2, unofficial].
